  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Low-cut retro trainers made for dual-sport athlete Deion Sanders during the 90s\nSynthetic leather base on the upper with nubuck overlays with a striking slash effect\nMidfoot strap with a hook-and-loop closure gives you a secure fit\nEmbroidered Swoosh embellishments throughout the upper for signature style\nFull-length foam midsole offers plush comfort\nVisible Max Air unit in the heel provides responsive cushioning\nRubber outsole enhances grip and shock absorption across surfaces\nThe Nike Air DT Max '96 Low is imported.\nLock in legendary style with the Little Kids' Nike Air DT Max ‘96 Low Casual Shoes. Originally made for Deion Sanders, these trainers represent the era when \"Prime Time\" ruled both the gridiron and the basepaths. The Diamond Turf Max ’96 remains a streetwear grail thanks to its unapologetically bold design, intentionally crafted to match the flashy, high-speed lifestyle of the most charismatic dual-sport superstar in history.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Little Kids' Nike Air DT Max ‘96 Low Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Preschool</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Metallic Gold/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3342448</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Preschool - Kids')</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike footwear size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 11C</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 10.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 28</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 12C</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 11.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 29.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 13C</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 12.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 31</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 1.0Y</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 13.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 32</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 1.5Y</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 1</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 33</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 2.0Y</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 1.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 33.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 2.5Y</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 2</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 34</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 3.0Y</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 2.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 35</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr></tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</details>\n",
